{"id":"vod_lz_19428","vodId":"19428","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"家有女友","name_cn":"家有女友","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220525-1/faa5bf8e0d8963b20e5395eb1a5ce129.jpg"},"summary":"藤井夏生（八代拓 配音）幼年时失去了母亲，因此对年长的女性充满了憧憬。一次偶然中，夏生在学校的楼顶遇见了英语老师橘阳菜（日笠阳子 配音），阳菜温柔的身影深深的将夏生吸引，令他不自觉的坠入了爱河。然而夏生知道，自己和老师是不可能有结果的，于是，他将郁闷发泄到了联谊活动之中。                                                                     　　在联谊会上，夏生邂逅了名为瑠衣（内田真礼 配音）的女孩，那一天，瑠衣将自己的第一次献给了夏生。之后，夏生的父亲告诉他自己即将再婚，而女方要带她的两个女儿住进夏生的家中。让夏生没有想到的是，这两个姑娘竟然正是阳菜和瑠衣。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-05-25 21:13:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220525/20101_6f272df7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220525/20104_40ff5d47/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220525/20103_45e1a3a6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220525/20105_365dbbe3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220525/20107_65980974/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220525/20106_c213509c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220525/20110_5f5e297e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220525/20109_12bb866c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220525/20108_69c45185/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220525/20111_62cc274c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220525/20113_e68b3fe5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220525/20112_b7e9deca/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:19.266Z"}